# Google OAuth Client ID
# To enable Google Sign-In:
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Create OAuth 2.0 Client ID (Web application)
# 3. Add authorized JavaScript origins: http://localhost:5173
# 4. Copy the Client ID and paste it below
# 5. Copy this file to .env and replace the empty value with your Client ID
# Format: 123456789012-abc...xyz.apps.googleusercontent.com
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
